Package: cherrycola
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12)
Recommends: python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Maintainer: GraceOS <https://github.com/itsHarshDabas/CherryCola>
Homepage: https://github.com/itsHarshDabas/CherryCola
Description: Run AI models on your own PC (Ollama, llama.cpp, LM Studio)
 CherryCola is a command line tool and a GTK chat app for local models.
 It drives Ollama, llama.cpp's llama-server or LM Studio's server, with
 per-model load and sampling settings, every llama.cpp option,
 requantizing, and streaming models bigger than RAM from disk.
 Install Ollama or llama.cpp separately; nothing is downloaded until you
 ask for a model.
